{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "市悅切，音熱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丑佳切，音吒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多早切，音怛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胎生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "濕生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云適意，又云白華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云柔輭，又云赤華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "更有藥法在本藏中，此隱不出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文下註云：更有藥法者，指實叉\n難陀與寶思惟。二譯本中，皆詳課誦法及和愛樂〔樂〕法也。須者檢之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普庚切，音烹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邱蓋切，音慨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與懾同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "煙上聲，蝘蜓守宮也。"}
